{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal Shift</strong> is a psychological horror game that takes place in a deserted airport terminal, which has been twisted\u00a0into a terrifying, looping nightmare. Escape by gathering numbers for the access code, while surviving encounters with a deadly entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/5e7fa38d8f8db2d2eb4fefc543615ded.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/5e7fa38d8f8db2d2eb4fefc543615ded.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/5e7fa38d8f8db2d2eb4fefc543615ded.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each loop contains a hidden number for the full access code. The code is procedurally generated and changes every loop, storing your input along the way. The number can be anywhere on the surface of the airport or can also be hidden as formed objects and even in patterns, such as flickering lights, sounds and unusual occurrences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/2c74e4d50739537b0505b451a6fd649f.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/2c74e4d50739537b0505b451a6fd649f.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/2c74e4d50739537b0505b451a6fd649f.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the number is identified, it should be inserted into the keypad device before proceeding to the next loop. Gather the full 10-digit code, gain access to the boarding gates and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/6d0ac51ce47dff4d5debbdcea6176b5c.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/6d0ac51ce47dff4d5debbdcea6176b5c.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/6d0ac51ce47dff4d5debbdcea6176b5c.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone! Be aware of the\u00a0unknown entity that lurks around the terminal, hunting you with its terrifying presence. Must be avoided at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/4c96e62286443eaf8677da876ebcb274.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/4c96e62286443eaf8677da876ebcb274.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/4c96e62286443eaf8677da876ebcb274.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional VHS camera mode. Bringing the nostalgic analog interface to the game. The mode is not enabled by default, it can be turned on in options, under the gameplay tab. This mode also allows the player to zoom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/75ce335a50768895d9a6be36ce84d4f9.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/75ce335a50768895d9a6be36ce84d4f9.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/75ce335a50768895d9a6be36ce84d4f9.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and realistic experience with minimal user interface and a chilling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an endless airport terminal and survive encounters with a deadly entity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic player movement system with immersive camera.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and analyze hidden numbers, throughout the loops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS interface mode with zooming mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty game modes.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856670?t=1765358167","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856670?t=1765358167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/37a09ed518028dada809df2550c44de63c9fae85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765358167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/37a09ed518028dada809df2550c44de63c9fae85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765358167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3949600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal Shift</strong> is a psychological horror game that takes place in a deserted airport terminal, which has been twisted\u00a0into a terrifying, looping nightmare. Escape by gathering numbers for the access code, while surviving encounters with a deadly entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/5e7fa38d8f8db2d2eb4fefc543615ded.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/5e7fa38d8f8db2d2eb4fefc543615ded.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/5e7fa38d8f8db2d2eb4fefc543615ded.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each loop contains a hidden number for the full access code. The code is procedurally generated and changes every loop, storing your input along the way. The number can be anywhere on the surface of the airport or can also be hidden as formed objects and even in patterns, such as flickering lights, sounds and unusual occurrences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/2c74e4d50739537b0505b451a6fd649f.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/2c74e4d50739537b0505b451a6fd649f.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/2c74e4d50739537b0505b451a6fd649f.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the number is identified, it should be inserted into the keypad device before proceeding to the next loop. Gather the full 10-digit code, gain access to the boarding gates and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/6d0ac51ce47dff4d5debbdcea6176b5c.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/6d0ac51ce47dff4d5debbdcea6176b5c.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/6d0ac51ce47dff4d5debbdcea6176b5c.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone! Be aware of the\u00a0unknown entity that lurks around the terminal, hunting you with its terrifying presence. Must be avoided at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/4c96e62286443eaf8677da876ebcb274.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/4c96e62286443eaf8677da876ebcb274.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/4c96e62286443eaf8677da876ebcb274.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional VHS camera mode. Bringing the nostalgic analog interface to the game. The mode is not enabled by default, it can be turned on in options, under the gameplay tab. This mode also allows the player to zoom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/75ce335a50768895d9a6be36ce84d4f9.poster.avif?t=1765358167\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/75ce335a50768895d9a6be36ce84d4f9.webm?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/extras/75ce335a50768895d9a6be36ce84d4f9.mp4?t=1765358167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and realistic experience with minimal user interface and a chilling atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an endless airport terminal and survive encounters with a deadly entity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic player movement system with immersive camera.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and analyze hidden numbers, throughout the loops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS interface mode with zooming mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty game modes.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Digital Star Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856670/53f5989b7018893d7d5e66c8976270572bd6e7eb/header.jpg?t=1765358167","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">